  "structuring": {
    "prompt_additions": "Colombia uses ARTICLE (artículo) as the basic unit, not SECTION. Higher divisions are TITLE (título) and CHAPTER (capítulo). BOOK (libro) is used only in major codes. Below articles: PARAGRAPH (parágrafo) for numbered supplementary provisions; inciso (unnumbered paragraph) requires post-processing. POINT maps to both numeral (arabic) and literal (alpha). Article numbers are continuous throughout the entire document and do not restart per chapter."
  },
